<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,550.84 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,550.84 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index finished officially at a second successive closing high of 7,550.84 points, up 47.11, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 4.942 billion forints, slightly below Thursday's 5.0 billion forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
